 up for the start of 40 laps around the Spa circuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"Nuvolari started from the last row but after just more than six minutes, the end of lap one, he had passed every car in front of him","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Williams lost time changing spark plugs when he visited the pits at the end of lap one and two.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":7,"text":"After 100 km Nuvolari leads by 17 seconds from Borzacchini and Chiron, who are a second apart; Varzi, Lehoux, Zehender and Dreyfus follow.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":9,"text":"Zehender loses ground and retires with transmission trouble; Markiewicz, at the rear, retires after a harmless crash.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":13,"text":"Nuvolari laps in 6m01s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"After 200 km Nuvolari leads Borzacchini by 36 seconds, Chiron by 50.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Williams had fallen further behind due to more stops for spark plugs and Sommer was beset with fuel pipe problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":18,"text":"Nuvolari makes a brief stop for fuel and new tyres, taking 1m40s; Chiron takes the lead and Nuvolari drops to fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"After 300 km Chiron leads Borzacchini, with Nuvolari third and Varzi fourth.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":22,"text":"Chiron's race ends while in the lead: his Alfa's differential breaks.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":23,"text":"Leader Borzacchini retires with a broken connecting rod; Nuvolari is back in front.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":27,"text":"After 400 km, Nuvolari held first place, 1m45s ahead of Varzi, 3m22s in front of Dreyfus, 3m48s to Lehoux and 6m11s ahead of Siena.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Varzi took up the challenge where Chiron had left off.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":34,"text":"At the completion of 500 km, Nuvolari was still in the lead with 3h28m42s. Varzi followed in second place with a gap of 2m14s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":39,"text":"Varzi changes a wheel in 14 seconds going into the last lap and keeps second place.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":40,"text":"After 4h09m11s, at an average speed of 143.6 km/h, Nuvolari was the victor in the Maserati monoposto.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"Varzi holds second, with Dreyfus finishing just three seconds behind him.","q":false,"c":1}]}